msgid ""
"Caspar mixer volume (0–1) for wipe stings (wipes/wipe*) on the PGM "
"EffectsPlayer. Unset: 1 (full). vMix stinger audio lives inside the vMix "
"inputs — this does not affect vMix-program studios."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Caspar producer for CAM1 from this field only (never hardcoded). Opened "
"once on camIngestChannel (default 5); look layers use MEDIA route://5 with "
"FILL — never a second DECKLINK/dshow on 3-115/4-115. dshow://video=… → "
"MEDIA on ingest. DECKLINK DEVICE N FORMAT … → TSR INPUT on ingest "
"(PlayDecklink). AMCP must include DEVICE — sofie-core Yarn-patches "
"casparcg-connection so PlayDecklink emits DECKLINK DEVICE <n>; "
"rebuild/restart playout-gateway to pick that up (blueprint re-upload alone "
"is not enough). After any change: re-upload blueprints if needed, then "
"Reset Rundown / re-activate so ingest baseline + look routes regenerate."
msgstr ""

