msgid ""
"CasparCG channel with the route bus + persistent overlays (logo-bug, "
"intro). Story looks are composed on BG A/B, not here. vMix studios: "
"clean-GFX channel only (logo, countup, intro/outro, look L3Ds) keyed over "
"the vMix program — no routes or wipes."
msgstr ""

