msgid ""
"vMix input number fed (e.g. via NDI) by the Caspar BG look A channel — "
"placed on layer 2 of lookAInput ABOVE the camera layer so graphics key over "
"the camera through the transparent cutout. Set 0 — or the same value as "
"lookAInput — to disable the feed overlay (legacy: camera layers on top of "
"the look feed)."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"vMix input number fed (e.g. via NDI) by the Caspar BG look B channel — "
"placed on layer 2 of lookBInput above the camera. Set 0 — or the same value "
"as lookBInput — to disable (legacy cam-on-top mode)."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"vMix input number fed (e.g. via NDI) by the Caspar PGM / clean-GFX channel. "
"Keyed as the baseline Overlay 1."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"vMix input number of the moderator mic (Audio In). Ramped down under SYN / "
"Intro / Outro. 0 disables mic ducking."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"vMix input number the PROGRAM bus switches to for look A. When "
"lookAFeedInput is set, this must be a composite (Virtual / multiview) input "
"— blueprints place the camera on layer 1 and the NDI look feed on layer 2 "
"above it. When lookAFeedInput is 0, this input is the NDI feed itself and "
"the camera sits on layer 1 above it (legacy mode)."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"vMix input number the PROGRAM bus switches to for look B. Same "
"composite-input contract as lookAInput (camera layer 1 under the NDI feed "
"on layer 2 when lookBFeedInput is set)."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"vMix input numbers that own the program bus. Used only when "
"visionMixer.type = Vmix with Caspar hypercomposed output (vMix switches "
"between the Caspar-rendered looks, keys clean GFX as Overlay 1, and plays "
"the kolíska beds)."
msgstr ""

